WEBVTT

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:06.434
Choose Add, then Split, and where it goes in the reel.

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:17.834
Side by side shows two videos at once. Choose the video and the part for the first cell.

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:27.117
Each cell has its own Select page. Choose a different moment for the second cell.

00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:37.362
Play the split: both parts move together in one picture.
